{"id":"9f82bb5282bf6867","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-von-neumann-algebra.md","title":"von Neumann Algebra","display":"df-von-neumann-algebra — von Neumann Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-von-neumann-algebra","aliases":["58-df-von-neumann-algebra"],"display":"df-von-neumann-algebra — von Neumann Algebra","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-von-neumann.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-von-neumann-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-von-neumann-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-von-neumann-algebra — von Neumann Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ec14d57629b7a4c\" href=\"?note=9ec14d57629b7a4c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-von-neumann.md\">../batch04/58-df-von-neumann.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H,M\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal H,M\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the canonical structure-witnessed predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ec14d57629b7a4c\" href=\"?note=9ec14d57629b7a4c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-von-neumann.md\">../batch04/58-df-von-neumann.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the compatibility alias defined here</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}von\\text{-}neumann\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}(M,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S(M,\\mathcal H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}von\\text{-}neumann\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}(M,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S(M,\\mathcal H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Von Neumann algebras are WOT/SOT-closed unital *-subalgebras of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(\\mathcal{H})\">\\(B(\\mathcal{H})\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Kaplansky density: the unit ball of a unital *-subalgebra is SOT-dense in the unit ball of its strong-operator closure.</li>\n<li>Von Neumann bicommutant theorem characterizes them by bicommutants.</li>\n<li>The local duplicate has been replaced by an exact alias to the canonical atom, whose two commutant witnesses and adjoint involution are explicit. This removes the unbound notations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M&#39;\">\\(M&#39;\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^*\">\\(T^*\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline M^{\\mathrm{WOT}}\">\\(\\overline M^{\\mathrm{WOT}}\\)</span> from object-level assertions here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-von-neumann.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ec14d57629b7a4c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-von-neumann.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-von-neumann.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ec14d57629b7a4c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the canonical structure-witnessed predicate from [[../batch04/58-df-von-neumann.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal H,M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}von\\text{-}neumann\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}(M,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VonNeumannAlgebra}_S(M,\\mathcal H)","display":true},{"tex":"B(\\mathcal{H})","display":false},{"tex":"M'","display":false},{"tex":"T^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(\\mathcal H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline M^{\\mathrm{WOT}}","display":false}],"bytes":1377,"backlinks":[{"id":"ef593f4bf65d6fd1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1371","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-von-neumann-algebra.md|58-df-von-neumann-algebra]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["9ec14d57629b7a4c"]}